1
00:01:06,032 --> 00:01:08,704
Maybe they don’t feel hungry in the morning,

2
00:01:08,896 --> 00:01:11,344
or they are too busy to eat anything.

3
00:01:12,032 --> 00:01:14,336
But food gives us energy.

4
00:01:14,928 --> 00:01:20,224
It is easy to feel sleepy and find it hard to focus on our work or studies

5
00:01:20,224 --> 00:01:21,920
if we don’t eat breakfast.

6
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:26,800
Some people also eat too many sweet things.

7
00:01:27,168 --> 00:01:30,656
Ice cream, sweets, and chocolate are delicious

8
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:33,296
but they usually have lots of sugar.

9
00:01:34,064 --> 00:01:36,352
This can cause tooth problems.

10
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,656
When you want a snack,

11
00:01:39,056 --> 00:01:41,472
why don’t you have some fruit instead?

12
00:01:42,064 --> 00:01:46,096
After all, an apple a day keeps the doctor away.

13
00:01:46,848 --> 00:01:49,392
Remember: You are what you eat.

14
00:01:49,952 --> 00:01:55,152
Healthy eating means eating healthy food and having good eating habits.

